WEBVTT

00:44.790 --> 00:47.890
It's you again, Tatsunosuke.

00:47.920 --> 00:49.000
You never give up, do you?

00:52.090 --> 00:53.850
I have no choice now.

00:53.880 --> 00:58.010
I don't want to, but I
must try my hidden power.

01:09.820 --> 01:10.820
What?

01:14.570 --> 01:15.570
Come on!

01:15.610 --> 01:16.500
Arrest him!

01:16.530 --> 01:18.070
Catch him!

01:19.530 --> 01:20.530
Wait a minute! Please!

01:21.540 --> 01:22.670
Please wait!

01:22.700 --> 01:23.950
Ouch!

02:54.130 --> 02:58.970
<i>Episode 5 Diamond Child.</i>

03:01.130 --> 03:02.480
Watch what you're doing!

03:02.510 --> 03:04.410
You sneaked your way
into the very residence

03:04.440 --> 03:06.320
of His Gracious Majesty
the chief minister.

03:06.350 --> 03:09.150
You should be rightfully
killed. However—.

03:09.180 --> 03:14.240
Our Majesty the chief minister felt pity
and has ordered us to give you a gold coin.

03:14.270 --> 03:15.770
Accept it with gratitude.

03:22.660 --> 03:24.170
No, thanks!

03:24.200 --> 03:27.920
I, Mr. Diamond, am a
master thief feared by all!

03:27.950 --> 03:32.500
I am not that desperate to
be grateful for just one coin.

03:35.960 --> 03:37.020
Shit!

03:37.050 --> 03:39.460
Everyone makes fun of me.

03:40.220 --> 03:41.440
Ouch!

03:41.470 --> 03:44.270
<i>Let people say
whatever they want.</i>

03:44.300 --> 03:45.270
Huh?

03:45.300 --> 03:46.390
Who is it?

03:48.970 --> 03:50.850
A crescent moon.

03:53.150 --> 03:57.240
A shining moon that is
full of life is beautiful...

03:57.270 --> 03:59.960
but I prefer this moon.

03:59.990 --> 04:02.790
The light, the life of the
moon is disappearing.

04:02.820 --> 04:04.990
Don't you think it's beautiful?

04:06.950 --> 04:08.990
Who the hell are you?

04:09.330 --> 04:12.470
I am a Kimon, and
my name is Aizen.

04:12.500 --> 04:15.000
How do you do, my friend?

04:16.670 --> 04:21.010
I have no reason to
become your friend.

04:38.820 --> 04:43.240
Why the hell do we have to
leave so early in the morning?

04:43.700 --> 04:47.540
We must get to the village
of Yagyu as soon as possible.

04:47.570 --> 04:50.340
If you don't like it, you can stay
here and sleep as long as you wish.

04:51.660 --> 04:54.210
It might be easier
for you to stay behind.

04:55.210 --> 04:56.750
Don't you agree, Jubei?

05:00.340 --> 05:02.640
Then what about our breakfast?

05:02.670 --> 05:04.190
Aren't we going to eat?

05:04.220 --> 05:05.220
Huh?

05:09.100 --> 05:11.190
G-Ghost!

05:11.220 --> 05:13.660
How diligent it is of him to
greet us so early in the morning.

05:41.210 --> 05:42.310
Shit!

05:42.340 --> 05:44.260
What prodigious strength!

05:51.720 --> 05:54.980
I'll leave the rest to you.

05:57.270 --> 05:58.270
Old man...

05:59.190 --> 06:01.770
I guess this guy's
just interested in me.

06:02.270 --> 06:03.620
Take Shigure and run!

06:03.650 --> 06:06.150
Come, Miss Shigure!

07:31.820 --> 07:33.660
Now, let's...

07:38.080 --> 07:39.500
Damn!

07:39.870 --> 07:41.470
I am so starving.

07:41.500 --> 07:45.340
But I can't go back
empty-handed.

07:53.550 --> 07:54.900
Lucky!

07:54.930 --> 07:56.350
I got myself a sucker.

08:07.360 --> 08:08.370
Hey!

08:08.400 --> 08:11.040
Are you going to ignore someone
who's down on the ground?

08:11.070 --> 08:13.920
Let go of me! I'm in a hurry!

08:13.950 --> 08:16.370
If you want me to let you
go, then give me some money!

08:19.370 --> 08:23.510
Hey! You! Give it back to me!

08:23.540 --> 08:25.880
Hey, Tatsunosuke!

08:28.800 --> 08:30.170
Long time, no see!

08:31.210 --> 08:32.600
Perfect timing.

08:32.630 --> 08:35.020
Sir, this guy is a thief.

08:35.050 --> 08:37.610
Mr. Diamond Tatsunosuke
and his henchman,

08:37.640 --> 08:39.400
you are under arrest!

08:39.430 --> 08:40.430
What?

08:41.020 --> 08:42.900
Oh, no, officer.

08:42.930 --> 08:44.320
I've got nothing
to do with this guy.

08:44.350 --> 08:45.870
I'm no henchman.

08:45.900 --> 08:47.370
I'm not going to get caught!

08:47.400 --> 08:49.400
Hey! Wait, you bastard!

08:51.400 --> 08:53.330
You just won't
give up, will you?

08:53.360 --> 08:54.170
Shut up!

08:54.200 --> 08:55.670
Gimme back my Stone!

08:55.700 --> 08:57.540
Wait!

08:57.570 --> 08:59.710
Hold on!

08:59.740 --> 09:01.260
Cheeky kids! You better stop!

09:01.290 --> 09:04.010
First thing first— Let's
get rid of them for now.

09:04.040 --> 09:05.180
Damn!

09:05.210 --> 09:06.970
Why do I have to get involved?

09:07.000 --> 09:08.930
Okay, follow me!

09:08.960 --> 09:11.000
Who said you could
order me around?

09:21.560 --> 09:24.780
Listen, when I tell you to
jump, jump as hard as you can.

09:24.810 --> 09:25.810
Okay.

09:29.520 --> 09:30.520
Jump!

09:40.330 --> 09:41.340
How did you like that?

09:41.370 --> 09:44.790
I knew this would come in handy.

10:21.370 --> 10:24.300
Hey... well, despite appearances,
I think you're a nice guy.

10:24.330 --> 10:25.300
I'll leave you right here.

10:25.330 --> 10:26.340
Wait a minute.

10:26.370 --> 10:27.910
We'll soon be there.

10:28.460 --> 10:31.380
After that huge tree,
we'll be in my country.

10:53.650 --> 10:55.660
Don't worry, Yayoi.

10:55.690 --> 10:58.500
This is my henchman, Tsubute.

10:58.530 --> 11:00.040
Who said I was your henchman?!

11:00.070 --> 11:05.000
Hey, this is my sister, Yayoi.

11:05.030 --> 11:07.510
Hey, what's with this bruise?

11:07.540 --> 11:09.050
It's nothing.

11:09.080 --> 11:11.370
And what about the money?

11:14.090 --> 11:15.970
I knew it!

11:16.000 --> 11:18.640
You go off somewhere
without even helping me here.

11:18.670 --> 11:22.940
H-Hey! I meant to work as
Mr. Diamond to get some.

11:22.970 --> 11:27.530
Always talking such nonsense, but
you never come back with any money.

11:27.560 --> 11:28.740
What?

11:28.770 --> 11:30.770
You useless bum!

11:33.560 --> 11:38.250
Okay, I got it. I'll help you.

11:38.280 --> 11:41.820
I'll do it. You
want me to plow?!

11:42.660 --> 11:46.990
If I put my mind to it, it's easy
to get a day's work done in a jiffy.

11:53.080 --> 11:54.250
I'm starved!

11:55.170 --> 11:56.250
Useless bum!

11:57.050 --> 11:58.760
Hey, henchman, say something!

11:58.920 --> 12:00.980
Blunderer! Asshole! Useless bum!

12:01.010 --> 12:02.650
Gee, that does it!

12:02.680 --> 12:05.010
You think you're so smart!

12:24.860 --> 12:26.120
What's the matter?

12:28.490 --> 12:31.290
Nothing will
grow with this soil.

12:32.160 --> 12:34.620
You guys did well
to make it so far.

12:35.120 --> 12:37.310
If you get hungry,
go into the woods.

12:37.340 --> 12:41.630
Grass, berries, I'll
show you what's edible.

12:42.550 --> 12:44.600
Are you from a mountain village?

12:44.630 --> 12:45.840
Something like that.

12:51.020 --> 12:52.890
Hey, how come you—.

12:54.100 --> 12:55.100
Oh.

12:56.150 --> 12:58.110
I will return that to you.

13:14.040 --> 13:15.180
See you then.

13:15.210 --> 13:16.670
Yeah.

13:22.050 --> 13:23.590
Tatsunosuke!

13:24.050 --> 13:26.720
You're not fit to be a thief.

13:27.680 --> 13:29.100
Get the hell out of here!

13:37.440 --> 13:38.990
Lemme go! You bastard!

13:39.020 --> 13:40.080
Shut up!

13:40.110 --> 13:44.900
I don't know where you come from,
but you've got no right to live here.

13:46.610 --> 13:48.880
You little bitch!

13:48.910 --> 13:53.040
We don't want to
be rough with you.

13:53.830 --> 13:55.130
Where is Tatsunosuke?

13:55.160 --> 13:56.340
I don't know.

13:56.370 --> 13:57.750
What?

14:03.210 --> 14:05.840
Even if I know where
he is, I will never tell you!

14:07.510 --> 14:09.230
Oh, how brave you are!

14:09.260 --> 14:11.980
You always show up when
Tatsunosuke is not here.

14:12.010 --> 14:13.350
You cowards!

14:14.060 --> 14:15.320
What did you say?

14:15.350 --> 14:16.600
Get lost!

14:17.850 --> 14:19.650
You brat!

14:31.490 --> 14:32.910
Get away!

14:43.500 --> 14:46.680
<i>Hey, what's with this bruise?</i>

14:46.710 --> 14:48.880
<i>It's nothing.</i>

14:53.260 --> 14:54.430
You bastards!

14:58.850 --> 15:02.940
What did you do...
To my little sister?!

15:30.380 --> 15:34.320
Aren't humans fragile?

15:34.350 --> 15:39.560
If you get really serious, it
will be easy for you to kill.

15:42.690 --> 15:45.490
You are a chosen human being.

15:45.520 --> 15:49.900
Join the Kimon Clan and use your
power to your maximum potential!

15:50.320 --> 15:56.620
Or you can live the rest of
your life being chased by officers.

15:59.120 --> 16:01.660
But I'm worried about Yayoi.

16:02.120 --> 16:05.750
All the more reason
why you should join.

16:25.230 --> 16:27.820
Oh, it's you...

16:29.440 --> 16:30.870
What's up?

16:30.900 --> 16:32.250
. Sorry.. Huh?

16:32.280 --> 16:36.780
I need that Stone
from you after all.

16:37.280 --> 16:38.250
What?

16:38.280 --> 16:41.550
Please! Just give it back to me.

16:41.580 --> 16:43.790
I don't want to hurt you!

16:43.870 --> 16:46.500
What are you talking about?

16:46.920 --> 16:47.920
Please!

16:52.260 --> 16:53.260
No, I can't.

16:55.010 --> 16:57.570
As I thought. I guess, no, huh?

16:57.600 --> 16:59.510
What's the matter with you?

17:00.060 --> 17:05.490
I... I am going
to join the Kimon.

17:05.520 --> 17:07.020
W-What?

17:10.360 --> 17:14.120
Hey! Do you know what
kind of people the Kimon are?

17:14.150 --> 17:16.410
Do you know them?

17:17.660 --> 17:23.870
A kid like you who can't even steal
a thing isn't fit to become a Kimon!

17:24.330 --> 17:25.500
Shut up!

17:32.880 --> 17:34.100
What's the matter?

17:34.130 --> 17:37.970
Your arms shrunk at
the crucial moment?

17:40.930 --> 17:42.140
Jeez.

17:42.720 --> 17:45.690
You can't even
take care of one kid.

17:45.980 --> 17:47.770
This useless bum!

17:50.690 --> 17:51.820
I am...

17:54.780 --> 17:58.700
I am... not a useless bum!

18:03.160 --> 18:04.160
It's okay.

18:05.910 --> 18:10.540
You are useless,
but that's okay.

18:12.710 --> 18:15.050
You useless bum!
You useless bum!

18:15.630 --> 18:18.300
You useless bum!

18:30.230 --> 18:31.360
Damn...

18:32.820 --> 18:33.820
Damn!

18:42.030 --> 18:43.870
Enough.

18:44.950 --> 18:48.040
I want both of you dead!

19:05.350 --> 19:07.990
For God's sake, I finally
caught up with you.

19:08.020 --> 19:09.350
And look at your poor state!

19:14.480 --> 19:16.150
Huh? Who's that?

19:17.990 --> 19:22.070
He's a useless bum who
almost joined the Kimon.

19:26.450 --> 19:27.910
Tsubute!

19:31.620 --> 19:33.630
Oh, he's back again!

19:41.010 --> 19:42.680
Tsubute! Let that sword go!

19:43.590 --> 19:47.430
Don't underestimate me!

20:36.230 --> 20:40.290
I guess this guy was being
manipulated by his sword.

20:40.320 --> 20:43.290
Hey, get UP-Have
you lost your strength?

20:43.320 --> 20:44.630
Stand up.

20:44.660 --> 20:46.660
You useless bum!

20:53.290 --> 20:54.640
Come on, stand up!

20:54.670 --> 20:56.670
Hey, Tatsunosuke!

20:57.250 --> 21:01.510
Tatsunosuke!

21:08.640 --> 21:09.760
I'm embarrassed.

21:10.310 --> 21:12.490
I was so hungry
that I got dizzy.

21:12.520 --> 21:15.820
You really fooled me! Why
don't you help your sister?!

21:15.850 --> 21:19.020
No, thanks! Don't forget that I
am the greatest thief, Mr. Diamond.

21:21.360 --> 21:23.240
You are a useless
bum, but a big eater.

21:29.280 --> 21:31.740
I can plow what
I ate in a jiffy.

21:33.910 --> 21:35.010
I'll see you.

21:35.040 --> 21:39.290
I'll make you my first henchman!

21:42.300 --> 21:46.050
What? Oh! Oh 0h!

21:47.340 --> 21:49.190
If you're looking for
this, I will keep it for now.

21:49.220 --> 21:50.730
You sneaky bastard,
when did you—.

21:50.760 --> 21:53.970
You are not fit to be a thief!

21:54.020 --> 21:55.270
Damn it!

21:55.350 --> 21:57.490
Give it back!
Give it back to me!

21:57.520 --> 21:59.980
Give it back!

23:29.950 --> 23:31.950
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:34.030 --> 23:35.450
A battle in the rain.

23:36.240 --> 23:40.710
Seeking shelter, Jubei wanders into
what was once a proud Warrior's home.

23:41.170 --> 23:46.210
Delirious, he finds a beautiful
woman tending to him.

23:46.670 --> 23:49.430
Then he must face the
Hiruko ninja Nenmu's

23:49.460 --> 23:52.510
assault, as well as the
woman's true identity.

23:53.010 --> 23:56.560
Next time on Ninja Scroll:
Shelter from the Rain.

23:56.970 --> 23:57.030
<i>Episode 6 Shelter from the Rain.</i>

23:57.060 --> 23:58.150
<i>Episode 6 Shelter
from the Rain Witness.</i>

23:58.180 --> 24:01.310
<i>Episode 6 Shelter from the Rain</i>
